WEBVTT

00:12:58.996 --> 00:13:01.596
RS: Oh, I love it, the Iceland
strike, oh my God, yes.

00:13:01.636 --> 00:13:04.756
Because, listen, I think that what
happened in Iceland essentially

00:13:04.796 --> 00:13:07.596
is women didn't go to work,
they didn't get on a train,

00:13:07.636 --> 00:13:09.836
they didn't make breakfast
for their partners

00:13:09.876 --> 00:13:12.076
and the entire country shut down.

00:13:12.436 --> 00:13:16.716
And that year they passed a really
progressive law on pay equity

00:13:16.756 --> 00:13:19.196
and they got more women
in elective office.

00:13:19.236 --> 00:13:23.556
But it was an eye opener for people like,
oh, wow, we really can't function,

00:13:23.596 --> 00:13:26.076
you know what I mean,
without women's participation.

00:13:26.116 --> 00:13:28.996
WPR: I'm curious
what you think is the thing

00:13:29.036 --> 00:13:32.676
that will ultimately motivate
us to actually make it happen.